description "Iridonian Heavy Gunner

Hardy Alien Heavy Gunners.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Overcharged Shock Baton (Red/Purple)
-- No Saber/Blaster Block
-- No Saber Training
-- Staggers/Pulses on hit
-- 10% more knockback
-- 50% shorter
-- 33% thicker
- Iridonian Repeater 
-- Minigun, Low Clip Size
-- 40%+ RoF, 5%+ Damage/FP Mult, Mag Reload
-- 60%+ Velocity
- Detached Ship Cannon
-- T21, Primary Only
-- 80%+ RoF, 40%- Damage
- Pulse Grenades (3)

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcements (1)
- Close Combat Training (1)
- Assemble (2)
- Healing (1)
- Beskar (1)
- Zabrak Strength (1)
- Stamina (1)
- Elemental Protection (2)
- Blast Armor 
- Dexterity (1)
- Armor Regen (2)

^8Abilities:
- Sprint (1) ^3[CS1]
- Quickthrow (1) ^3[CS2]
- Stimpack ^3[CS3]
- Iridonian Placement GUn ^3[CS4]

"